    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <div class="alert-content--body">
                  <h2 id="alert-wawrning-title--312740499" >Sign Up for Emergency Alerts</h2>
        
                  <div class="alert-content--body--details">
            
  <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-alert__details field--type-text-long field--label-visually_hidden">
    <div class="field__label visually-hidden">Details</div>
              <div class="field__item"><p>Alert Iowa is State of Iowa’s official emergency notification system. <a href="https://homelandsecurity.iowa.gov/programs/alert-iowa" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c6020427-bc52-4c5c-8511-92def19fe039" data-entity-substitution="canonical"><strong>Learn if your county is participating</strong></a>. &nbsp;Sign up to receive free alerts via text message, email, or voice.</p></div>
          </div>

          </div>
        
                  <div class="alert-content--body--published">Published on
              May 21, 2024</div><div class="alert-content--body--updated">; last updated on
                August 22, 2024</div>              </div>

              <div class="alert-content--link">
          

  

  <a  data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" target="_blank" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="https://homelandsecurity.iowa.gov/programs/alert-iowa" rel="" aria-label="Alert sign up (link is external, opens in a new window)">
  Alert sign up</a>


        </div>
          </div>
  </div>
</article>



